sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Jo‘natuvchi brauzeri
  participant API as MessageController
  participant S as MessageService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant H as ChatHub (SignalR)
  participant B as Qabul qiluvchi brauzeri
  B->>H: WebSocket ulanish (JWT), JoinChat(chatId)
  A->>API: POST /api/chats/{chatId}/messages
  API->>S: SendAsync(userId, chatId, matn)
  S->>DB: Validatsiya, a’zolikni tekshirish
  S->>DB: INSERT messages
  S->>H: MessageCreatedAsync(xabar, a’zolar)
  H-->>B: MessageReceived (user:{id} guruhi)
  API-->>A: 201 Created (MessageDto)
  B->>H: MarkMessagesRead(chatId, [id])
  H->>DB: INSERT message_views
  H-->>A: MessagesRead → “o‘qildi” (✓✓)
  B->>H: SetTyping(chatId, true)
  H-->>A: TypingChanged → “yozmoqda…”
